DreamWorldSpaceRaycaster:TraceChannel {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamWorldSpaceRaycaster.h#DreamWorldSpaceRaycaster:TraceChannel
    src   "Which world-space canvases this raycaster answers for: only roots whose own TraceChannel is the\nsame. With bOccludeByWorld (on by default) it is also the collision channel the occlusion trace\nuses, so \"what this pointer can touch\" and \"what can block it\" stay one setting: moving a pointer\nto another channel moves both, and its panels have to move with it."
    text  "此射线投射器负责哪些世界空间画布：只有自身 TraceChannel 相同的\n根。配合 bOccludeByWorld（默认开启）时，它也是遮挡追踪\n所用的碰撞通道，因此“此指针能碰到什么”与“什么能阻挡它”是同一个设置：把指针\n移到另一个通道会同时移动两者，其面板也必须随之移动。"
    state machine
}

